            </note>
            <note corresp="#d615-f2" n="12" xml:id="d615-f2-content">
                <p>Treaty of July 2, 1925; <ref target="frus1925v02#pg_32"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Foreign Relations</hi>, 1925, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">ii</hi>,
                        p. 32</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d615-f3" n="13" xml:id="d615-f3-content">
                <p>Further negotiations did not result in the signing of a treaty.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
